Also, I've received some emails about problems with compiling XPilot.  Please
notice that

* XPilot requires an ANSI C compiler, or you'll have to run it through some
  de-ANSI-fy tool.

* The default values for CC, CCOPTIONS and CDEBUGFLAGS are for the standard
  HP compiler (8.07) and must not be used on gcc.  I now see I shouldn't have
  chosen so special defaults. :)

  Useful options for gcc on a Sun Sparc is CC=gcc, CCOPTIONS=-nostdinc and
  CDEBUGFLAGS=-O.

* If you're using gcc, it has to be in working order and configured right :)


